OL,3,ADramatic insider warnings over AI fall
OL,4,Aflat with some in Silicon Valley
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoxon, a 27-year-old who worked at
OL,7,FOpenAI before joining its chief rival
OL,8,FAnthropic, said on Tuesday that people
OL,9,Fbuilding artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,10,Fbelieved the technology could destroy
OL,11,Fhumanity.
OL,13,FThey are "gambling with our lives", he
OL,14,Fsaid, "these will soon be superhuman
OL,15,Fsystems that can hack anything".
